{"data":[{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-04-08T11:08:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2041835684600914006"],"id":"2041835684600914006","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":16835,"like_count":38,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":45,"retweet_count":0},"text":"开裆蜘蛛侠战袍我马上要出视频版了，看过照片版感觉还算不错的宝宝可以在期待一下，穿完这一次明早就扔了，有人想要看我变身蜘蛛侠吗？＃抽象 ＃蜘蛛侠","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2041835684600914006"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-04-08T01:41:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2041692922333294842"],"id":"2041692922333294842","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":61,"impression_count":112196,"like_count":481,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":144,"retweet_count":19},"text":"避雷！提醒大家，不要点炸鸡，不要点粥，不要点酸酸菜鱼，不要点下饭菜，不要点小碗菜，不要点名字中间带·的外卖，不要点叫花鸡，不要点名字叫什么现炒现煮的，要点就点连锁店，带堂食的外卖！ https://t.co/aP56hc7xUy","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2041692922333294842"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-04-07T14:01:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2041516790610907315"],"id":"2041516790610907315","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":33588,"like_count":111,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":58,"retweet_count":1},"text":"你们没有跑过外卖，所以你们不知道有些商家是在什么环境给你们出的餐食，我现在也是有双火眼金睛只能说一言难尽... https://t.co/rj2pHtim2R","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2041516790610907315"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-04-07T09:41:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2041451207508856855"],"id":"2041451207508856855","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":35182,"like_count":63,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":0},"text":"被顾客差评我就这样 https://t.co/TPuiC3iOoN","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2041451207508856855"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2026-04-07T01:00:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2041320107281170452"],"id":"2041320107281170452","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":47146,"like_count":175,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":